Fix: Set net.ipv4.icmp_ignore_bogus_error_responses=1 in /etc/sysctl.d.
References: sysctl.d(5); Linux kernel ip-sysctl documentation
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST SC-5, SC-7; ISO 8.20; CE Secure configuration

